== Trivia ==
* In ''Antibirth'', Bethany was unlocked by having a total number of 12 {{e|Soul Heart}}s or {{e|Black Heart}}s at once.
* Conceptually, Bethany first began as the main character for a game envisioned by developer Kilburn as a college research project, originally named "Dora".<ref>https://twitter.com/FixItVinh/status/1394143025706713088</ref> She was added to ''The Binding of Isaac: Antibirth'' (the fan creation that would later become ''Repentance'') after Kilburn deduced that she wouldn't be out of place <ref>https://twitter.com/FixItVinh/status/1394143339759419394</ref> in the game.
** Her name is a reference to [[wikipedia: Mary of Bethany|Mary of Bethany]]. She was the sister of {{C|Lazarus}}, and is sometimes identified as Mary Magdalene or as an anonymous sinful woman in the Gospel of Luke.
*** [[wikipedia:Bethany|Bethany]], the village Mary lived in, was a town in the West Bank of Jerusalem. [[wikipedia:Martha|Martha]] and [[wikipedia:Lazarus of Bethany|Lazarus]] likewise lived there, and the raising of Lazarus from the dead occurred there as well.
* Bethany's locked Icon shows her bound in chains.
** She shares this with {{C|Magdalene}}, {{C|Cain}}, {{C|Samson}}, {{C|Eve}}, {{C|Lazarus}}, and {{C|Jacob and Esau}}.

